# Dynamics, Geometry, And Physical Analogues

Status: recovery and frontier.

Modules: `ClosureFlowDynamics`, `Flow.CurvatureRegime`,
`FiringBlowup`, `Flow.NSCFiring`, `BlowupClassification`,
`FreeEnergyLyapunov`, `Optimization`, `Probability.Stochastic`,
`Probability.Measure`, `CausalSets.Causal.Order`,
`CausalSets.Dimension.OrderingFraction`, `LawvereLaplacianSpectralGap`,
`Laplacianizability`, `AlexandrovHusainov`, `TransfiniteCellComplex`,
`SettlingCoalgebra`.

This family is where Obsmetrologia begins to behave like a research lab for dynamics,
geometry, optimization, probability, and physical analogy. These pages need extra
provenance and status discipline because the bridge claims can be tempting and
large.

`ClosureFlowDynamics`, `Flow.CurvatureRegime`, `FiringBlowup`,
`Flow.NSCFiring`, and `BlowupClassification` document dynamical
behavior of closure and firing. `FreeEnergyLyapunov`, `Optimization`,
`Probability.Stochastic`, and `Probability.Measure` recover variational and
probabilistic language.

`CausalSets.Causal.Order`, `CausalSets.Dimension.OrderingFraction`,
`LawvereLaplacianSpectralGap`, `Laplacianizability`, `AlexandrovHusainov`,
`TransfiniteCellComplex`, and `SettlingCoalgebra` bridge toward geometry,
spectral structure, causal order, and coalgebraic dynamics.

Reader warning: physical analogues must be documented as analogues unless the
formal bridge has been proved. The status label should do real work.
